    <title>Register now for Drupalcamp Spain 2011</title>
    <link>http://2011.drupalcamp.es/en/news/register-now-drupalcamp-spain-2011</link>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;We&#039;ve open the register for the attendees willing to come to Sevilla and participate with the Spanish community in the biggest Drupal event in Spain.&lt;br /&gt;
You can now propose sessions, complete your user profile and join the forums.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;http://2011.drupalcamp.es/drupalcamp-spain-2011&quot;&gt;Buy your ticket now&lt;/a&gt; and don&#039;t lose this opportunity.&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
