  <item>
    <title>Drupalcamp pre-registration now open</title>
    <link>http://2011.drupalcamp.es/en/news/drupalcamp-pre-registration-now-open</link>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;The pre-registration for the attendants who want to start getting involved in the Drupalcamp is now open, and you will be able to propose sessions, complete your user&#039;s profile and participate in the forums. &lt;a href=&quot;http://2011.drupalcamp.es/user/register&quot;&gt;Register now&lt;/a&gt; and be the first one to find out all the news.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Also, if you want to get involved with the organization of the event, just visit the &lt;a href=&quot;http://oa.drupalcamp.es/&quot;&gt;Open Atrium site&lt;/a&gt; we are using to organize it.&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
