  <item>
    <title>Drupalcamp Spain 2011 website just opened</title>
    <link>http://2011.drupalcamp.es/en/news/drupalcamp-spain-2011-website-just-opened</link>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;Here we are! We present you the website of the Drupalcamp Seville 2011. The congress that no spanish drupaler can afford to miss.&lt;br /&gt;
After the big success of the first edition in Barcelona, this year will come with a taste of Andalusia, in Seville, October 1st and 2nd.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Come to share with us your experience in 2011, a fantastic opportunity to meet the international Drupal community, and especially notable for the release of the new Drupal 7. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Propose a new session, share your knowledge and get involved with the wonderful local developer community.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Don&#039;t miss your chance to spend a wonderful weekend in the South of Spain, we are counting on you!&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
